{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17768","headline":"怀德抒情寄上信州座主 · 杨巨源","name":"怀德抒情寄上信州座主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五马江天郡，诸生泪共垂。\n讌余明主德，恩在侍臣知。\n怅望缄双鲤，龙锺假一枝。\n玉峰遥寄梦，云海暗伤离。\n幢盖全家去，琴书首路随。\n沧州值康乐，明月向元规。\n鵷凤终凌汉，蛟龙会出池。\n蕙香因曙发，松色肯寒移。\n举世瞻风藻，当朝揖羽仪。\n加餐门下意，溪水绿逶迤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}